Package: mymate-agent
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Athena Networks <sales@athenanetworks.com.au>
Depends: ca-certificates
Section: net
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/AthenaNetworks/mymate
Description: My Mate remote agent (probe)
 A lightweight probe that runs inside a remote or management network and connects
 out to a central My Mate server over an outbound WebSocket, polling the devices
 on that network locally on the server's behalf. Install it on a small VM,
 container or Raspberry Pi at each site.
 .
 On install it asks for the My Mate server URL and this agent's token, writes the
 configuration and starts a hardened systemd service that reconnects on failure.
